  "aliases": [],
  "summary": "视频播放器底部控制条：播放/暂停 + 三段进度条（已播/缓冲/未播，可拖拽 seek）+ 时间 + 音量 + 全屏；hover 从底部淡入，静置后淡出。",
  "usage": "视频播放器、课程播放页、产品演示视频这类需要底部控制条的播放场景。",
  "caution": "纯音频播放用「音频波形播放条」，不要套这个控件；直播场景不需要缓冲段和进度拖动。",
  "hint": "鼠标移上去控件出现，静置一会儿淡出；拖进度条可跳转",
  "inspiration": "",
  "related": [
    "音频波形播放条"
  ],
  "prompt": "【视频播放控件】目标：一个视频播放器的底部控制条——播放/暂停按钮、进度条（已播 / 缓冲 / 未播三段）、时间、音量、全屏；控件平时隐藏，鼠标移到画面上从底部淡入，静置约 3 秒后淡出；进度条可拖拽 seek，三段都按百分比连续渲染（不要按段/格切 class）。\n\n1) 结构：.stage 是 `position:absolute; inset:0` 的播放区（背景用 `linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 80%,var(--ui-bg)), color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 56%,var(--ui-bg)))` 模拟深色画面 + 一层 radial 高光），.controls 是 `position:absolute; left/right/bottom:10px` 的浮层（不占画面高度），内部：播放按钮、.track、时间、音量、全屏。\n2) 控件浮层：`background: color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 60%,transparent)` + `backdrop-filter:blur(8px)` + 低对比边框 + 圆角；默认 `opacity:0; transform:translateY(8px); pointer-events:none`，`.stage.show .controls` 时显示，过渡 `opacity .28s, transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)`。\n3) 进度条三段（**关键：三段都用 width 百分比连续更新**）：.track 未播底（文字色 22%）、.buf 缓冲（文字色 40%）、.played 已播（--ui-brand）。渲染：`played.width = progress*100%`、`buf.width = buffered*100%`、`thumb.left = progress*100%`。\n4) **缓冲（buffered）必须和播放位置解耦（关键）**：缓冲 = 网络已下载的数据范围，**不是**「播放位置+一段」。用独立变量 + 独立下载时钟推进：`buffered = Math.min(1, buffered + dt/30000)`（30 秒下完整片），初始 `buffered = 0.5` 左右；**拖动 seek 只改 progress，绝不能改 buffered**。拖动期间 tick 里直接跳过（进度和缓冲都不推进），松手后继续。这样拖到 70% 时已播 70%、缓冲仍在原来的下载位置（比如 52%），已播段会盖住缓冲段——这才是真实播放器的样子。\n5) 拖动 seek：track 上 pointerdown（preventDefault + setPointerCapture try/catch + 立即按 `(e.clientX - rect.left)/rect.width` 更新 progress）→ pointermove 实时 → pointerup/cancel 释放；拖动期间 rAF 不推进；track 加 `touch-action:none`，拖动时 thumb 放大到 11px。\n6) 显隐逻辑：stage 的 mousemove/mouseenter → 显示控件并重置「静置 2.8 秒淡出」计时器；mouseleave → 1.4 秒后淡出；拖动中不淡出。\n7) 按钮：播放/暂停两个 SVG 叠放，靠 `.cbtn.playing` 切 display（play 用 fill 三角、pause 用 stroke 双竖线）；音量按钮 `.muted` 切喇叭/静音图标；全屏按钮 `.full` 切展开/收起图标；按钮 aria-label 同步。\n8) 演示（卡片预览自动播）：进入即播放（rAF 推进进度，真实时长 48 秒），控件按「显示 3 秒 → 淡出 → 2.2 秒后再显示」循环，模拟静置淡出；弹窗初始控件条直接显示（目标态），用户可 hover / 拖动。\n9) 无障碍：进度条 role=\"slider\" + aria-valuemin/max/now（每秒同步）+ aria-label「播放进度，可拖动」；按钮 aria-label 随状态切换；时间不设 aria-live。\n10) 坑：①播放/暂停两个 SVG 必须用类切 display，否则两个图标叠在一起；②三段宽度都用百分比连续更新，别按段切 class；③**缓冲不能跟着播放头/拖动走**——它是下载进度，用 `buffered += dt/30000` 独立推进；把缓冲写成 `min(1, progress+0.25)` 是概念错误，用户拖进度条时会看到「缓存跟指针一起长」；④拖动时 rAF 不推进（progress 和 buffered 都不动），否则松手后位置会跳、缓冲也会被拖动污染；⑤track 只有 3px 高，要加 `::before` 扩展上下热区（top/bottom -7px）才好拖；⑥控件浮层在画面上要半透明 + blur，纯色会挡画面；⑦不设 pointer-events:none 时隐藏的控件会挡住画面点击；⑧弹窗里控件按 32px 按钮、5px 进度条放大。\n11) 配色：已播 --ui-brand、缓冲文字色 40%、未播文字色 22%、控件浮层 --ui-bg 60% 透明、时间 --ui-text-dim。\n12) 使用场景：视频播放器、课程播放页、产品演示视频；音频播放用「音频波形播放条」，不要用这个控件。",
  "demoHtml": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{height:100%}\nbody{margin:0;overflow:hidden;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",system-ui,\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif;color:var(--ui-text);background:var(--ui-bg)}\n\n.stage{position:absolute;inset:0;overflow:hidden}\n.vfill{position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:linear-gradient(135deg,color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 80%,var(--ui-bg)),color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 56%,var(--ui-bg)))}\n.vfill::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;\n  background:radial-gradient(circle at 30% 32%,color-mix(in srgb,#fff 12%,transparent),transparent 46%)}\n.vchips{position:absolute;left:12px;top:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px}\n.vchip{font-size:7.5px;font-weight:600;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 88%,transparent);\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 22%,transparent);border-radius:5px;padding:2px 6px;backdrop-filter:blur(4px)}\n.vcenter{position:absolute;inset:0;display:grid;place-items:center;pointer-events:none}\n.vcenter span{font-size:9px;color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 70%,transparent);letter-spacing:1px}\n\n/* ---------- 控件条：底部淡入 ---------- */\n.controls{position:absolute;left:10px;right:10px;bottom:10px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;\n  padding:6px 8px;border-radius:9px;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 60%,transparent);\n  border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent);\n  backdrop-filter:blur(8px);\n  opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);pointer-events:none;\n  transition:opacity .28s ease,transform .3s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.25,1)}\n.stage.show .controls{opacity:1;transform:none;pointer-events:auto}\n\n.cbtn{flex:0 0 auto;width:18px;height:18px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:0;border-radius:5px;\n  background:transparent;color:var(--ui-text);cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .15s ease,transform .12s ease}\n.cbtn:hover{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 10%,transparent)}\n.cbtn.pressing,.cbtn:active{transform:scale(.92)}\n.cbtn svg{display:block;width:11px;height:11px;fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}\n.cbtn .i-play{fill:currentColor;stroke:none}\n.cbtn .i-pause{display:none}\n.cbtn.playing .i-play{display:none}\n.cbtn.playing .i-pause{display:block}\n.cbtn .i-mute{display:none}\n.cbtn.muted .i-vol{display:none}\n.cbtn.muted .i-mute{display:block}\n.cbtn .i-expand{display:block}\n.cbtn.full .i-expand{display:none}\n.cbtn.full .i-collapse{display:block}\n.cbtn .i-collapse{display:none}\n\n/* 进度条：已播 / 缓冲 / 未播三段，宽度按百分比连续更新 */\n.track{position:relative;flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;\n  background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 22%,transparent);\n  cursor:pointer;touch-action:none;min-width:24px}\n.track::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-7px;bottom:-7px}\n.buf{position:absolute;inset:0;width:0;border-radius:2px;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-text) 40%,transparent)}\n.played{position:absolute;inset:0;width:0;border-radius:2px;background:var(--ui-brand)}\n.thumb{position:absolute;top:50%;left:0;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--ui-brand);\n  transform:translate(-50%,-50%);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ui-bg) 85%,transparent);pointer-events:none;transition:width .12s ease,height .12s ease}\n.track.dragging .thumb{width:11px;height:11px}\n\n.t{flex:0 0 auto;font-size:7.5px;color:var(--ui-text-dim);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap;margin-left:1px}\n\n@media (min-height:421px){\n  .vchip{font-size:12px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:7px}\n  .vcenter span{font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px}\n  .controls{left:18px;right:18px;bottom:18px;gap:12px;padding:11px 14px;border-radius:14px}\n  .cbtn{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px}\n  .cbtn svg{width:19px;height:19px}\n  .track{height:5px;border-radius:3px}\n  .thumb{width:13px;height:13px}\n  .track.dragging .thumb{width:17px;height:17px}\n  .t{font-size:12px;margin-left:3px}\n}\n@media (max-height:420px){\n  .vchip{font-size:6.5px;padding:1px 4px;border-radius:4px}\n  .vcenter span{font-size:8px}\n  .controls{left:8px;right:8px;bottom:8px;gap:5px;padding:4px 6px;border-radius:7px}\n  .cbtn{width:16px;height:16px}\n  .cbtn svg{width:10px;height:10px}\n  .track{height:2px;border-radius:2px}\n  .thumb{width:7px;height:7px}\n  .t{font-size:7px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){\n  .controls,.cbtn,.thumb{transition:none}\n}\n</style></head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"stage\" id=\"stage\">\n  <div class=\"vfill\"></div>\n  <div class=\"vchips\"><span class=\"vchip\">产品介绍</span><span class=\"vchip\">1080p</span></div>\n  <div class=\"vcenter\"><span>播放中</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"controls\" id=\"controls\">\n    <button class=\"cbtn playing\" id=\"playBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"暂停\">\n      <svg class=\"i-play\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 5.5l11 6.5-11 6.5z\"/></svg>\n      <svg class=\"i-pause\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 5v14M15 5v14\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n\n    <div class=\"track\" id=\"track\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"slider\" aria-label=\"播放进度，可拖动\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"48\" aria-valuenow=\"0\">\n      <div class=\"buf\" id=\"buf\"></div>\n      <div class=\"played\" id=\"played\"></div>\n      <i class=\"thumb\" id=\"thumb\"></i>\n    </div>\n\n    <span class=\"t\" id=\"time\">0:12 / 0:48</span>\n\n    <button class=\"cbtn\" id=\"volBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"静音\">\n      <svg class=\"i-vol\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9z\"/><path d=\"M16.5 8.5a5 5 0 010 7\"/></svg>\n      <svg class=\"i-mute\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9v6h4l5 4V5L8 9z\"/><path d=\"M16 9.5l5 5M21 9.5l-5 5\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n\n    <button class=\"cbtn\" id=\"fsBtn\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"全屏\">\n      <svg class=\"i-expand\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 9V4h5M20 9V4h-5M4 15v5h5M20 15v5h-5\"/></svg>\n      <svg class=\"i-collapse\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 4v5H4M15 4v5h5M9 20v-5H4M15 20v-5h5\"/></svg>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var stage = document.getElementById('stage'),\n      controls = document.getElementById('controls'),\n      playBtn = document.getElementById('playBtn'),\n      track = document.getElementById('track'),\n      buf = document.getElementById('buf'),\n      played = document.getElementById('played'),\n      thumb = document.getElementById('thumb'),\n      timeEl = document.getElementById('time'),\n      volBtn = document.getElementById('volBtn'),\n      fsBtn = document.getElementById('fsBtn');\n\n  var DR = 48;              /* 视频总时长（秒） */\n  var progress = 0.25;      /* 播放位置，从 0:12 开始 */\n  var buffered = 0.5;       /* 已缓冲范围：独立的下载时钟，与播放位置/拖动无关 */\n  var playing = true, dragging = false;\n  var rafId = 0, last = 0, hideTimer = 0, demoTimer = 0;\n\n  function later(fn, ms){ demoTimer = setTimeout(fn, ms); return demoTimer; }\n\n  function fmt(sec){\n    sec = Math.max(0, Math.min(DR, Math.round(sec)));\n    return Math.floor(sec / 60) + ':' + ('0' + (sec % 60)).slice(-2);\n  }\n\n  /* 像素级连续：只改三段宽度百分比，不逐段切 class */\n  function render(){\n    var p = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, progress));\n    played.style.width = (p * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';\n    buf.style.width = (buffered * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';\n    thumb.style.left = (p * 100).toFixed(2) + '%';\n    timeEl.textContent = fmt(p * DR) + ' / ' + fmt(DR);\n    track.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', String(Math.round(p * DR)));\n  }\n\n  function tick(now){\n    if(!playing) return;\n    if(!last) last = now;\n    var dt = now - last;\n    last = now;\n    if(!dragging){\n      progress += dt / (DR * 1000);\n      if(progress >= 1) progress = 0;\n      /* 缓冲是「网络已下载范围」，由独立下载时钟推进：30 秒下完整片，与播放位置/拖动无关 */\n      buffered = Math.min(1, buffered + dt / 30000);\n      render();\n    }\n    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n\n  function play(){\n    if(playing) return;\n    playing = true;\n    last = 0;\n    playBtn.classList.add('playing');\n    playBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', '暂停');\n    rafId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  }\n  function pause(){\n    if(!playing) return;\n    playing = false;\n    playBtn.classList.remove('playing');\n    playBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', '播放');\n    cancelAnimationFrame(rafId);\n  }\n  playBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){ if(playing) pause(); else play(); });\n\n  /* ---------- 控件显隐：hover / 静置淡出 ---------- */\n  function showControls(){\n    stage.classList.add('show');\n    clearTimeout(hideTimer);\n    hideTimer = setTimeout(function(){\n      if(!dragging) stage.classList.remove('show');\n    }, 2800);\n  }\n  stage.addEventListener('mousemove', showControls);\n  stage.addEventListener('mouseenter', showControls);\n  stage.addEventListener('mouseleave', function(){\n    if(dragging) return;\n    clearTimeout(hideTimer);\n    hideTimer = setTimeout(function(){ stage.classList.remove('show'); }, 1400);\n  });\n\n  /* ---------- 拖动 seek ---------- */\n  function seekFromEvent(e){\n    var r = track.getBoundingClientRect();\n    progress = Math.max(0, Math.min(1, (e.clientX - r.left) / r.width));\n    render();\n  }\n  track.addEventListener('pointerdown', function(e){\n    e.preventDefault();\n    dragging = true;\n    track.classList.add('dragging');\n    try { track.setPointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(_e){}\n    seekFromEvent(e);\n    showControls();\n  });\n  track.addEventListener('pointermove', function(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    seekFromEvent(e);\n  });\n  function endDrag(e){\n    if(!dragging) return;\n    dragging = false;\n    track.classList.remove('dragging');\n    try { track.releasePointerCapture(e.pointerId); } catch(_e){}\n    if(playing){ last = 0; }\n    showControls();\n  }\n  track.addEventListener('pointerup', endDrag);\n  track.addEventListener('pointercancel', endDrag);\n\n  /* 音量 / 全屏：只做状态切换 */\n  volBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    volBtn.classList.toggle('muted');\n    volBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', volBtn.classList.contains('muted') ? '取消静音' : '静音');\n  });\n  fsBtn.addEventListener('click', function(){\n    fsBtn.classList.toggle('full');\n    fsBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', fsBtn.classList.contains('full') ? '退出全屏' : '全屏');\n  });\n\n  function demoCycle(){\n    clearTimeout(demoTimer);\n    showControls();\n    /* 播放中：每轮展示「显示 → 静置淡出 → 再显示」 */\n    later(function(){ if(!dragging) stage.classList.remove('show'); }, 3000);\n    later(demoCycle, 5200);\n  }\n\n  render();\n  rafId = requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n  if(window.__uiInteractive){\n    /* 弹窗初始态：控件条已显示（目标态） */\n    stage.classList.add('show');\n  } else {\n    setTimeout(demoCycle, 300);\n  }\n})();\n</script>\n</body></html>",
